    "created_at": "2019-09-26T19:39:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-26T19:39:58Z",
    "body": "So for example, if you are in the PST time zone, right now with just\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[time]\r\ndisabled = false\r\n```\r\n\r\nyou would see:\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nat 12:36:17 ❯\r\n```\r\n\r\nbut you could have a `timezone` option, so that e.g. you might have a config like:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[time]\r\ndisabled = false\r\ntimezone = \"UTC\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nand see:\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nat 19:36:17 ❯\r\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
